    "body": "## Core Functionality\n\n* Location data storage system\n* Geographic entity tracking (countries, cities, roads)\n* Map visualization component\n* Statistics calculation for visited places\n\n## User Stories\n\n* As a user, I want to record my location data to track where I've been\n* As a user, I want to see a list of countries I've visited\n* As a user, I want to view cities I've explored\n* As a user, I want to track roads I've traveled on\n* As a user, I want to visualize my travel history on a map\n* As a user, I want to see completion statistics for geographic areas\n\n## Related Features\n\n* Data import from GPS files or fitness apps\n* Offline location tracking capability\n",
